    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests {@link EnumUtils#generateBitVectors(Class, Iterable)}. <p>{@code generateBitVectors} encodes a subset of an enum as a {@code long[]} bit vector. Each enum constant maps to the bit at its ordinal position; constant {@code N} sets bit {@code N}. Because a {@code long} only holds 64 bits, enums with more than 64 constants spill into additional {@code long}s, and the returned array is ordered with the most significant block first (least significant digits rightmost).</p>"
   },
